  "bodyHash": "e4f0e90b4711c607",
  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/bundle.png\" alt=\"一个 Serilum 整合包。倾注心血制作。将 Serilum 的模组整合在一起，方便下载！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fSerilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h2><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-bundle.svg\" alt=\"关于此整合包\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">**出生点整合包** 是一种特殊的模组，它将 Serilum 的多个**出生点类型**模组整合到了同一个文件中。虽然我将自己的模组归类到一起非常困难，但我尝试了这样做以便大家更容易安装。它使用了一种名为 JiJ（Jar in Jar）的系统。这意味着包含的模组保持完全独立，同时允许像整合包一样捆绑安装。所有模组仍然拥有各自的配置文件，并且你会在游戏内的模组列表中看到它们。<br><br>该整合包是整合包开发的辅助工具，但并不能完全替代我个人偏好的模块化模组系统。不过，你可以通过整合包的配置文件禁用其中包含的模组。**更改生效需要重启游戏。**<br><br>由于 JiJ 系统的工作方式，它与正常安装该模组以及同时安装整合包内包含的模组都兼容。这主要用于强制使用特定版本，而且即使不小心通过这种方式重复安装了模组也不会造成问题。虽然可能不会导致冲突，但最好还是只安装一次。因此，如果你决定安装此整合包，可以移除其他已包含在内的模组。<br><br>希望这个整合包对偏好大型内容模组的你们有所帮助。感谢多年来大家一直以来的支持！<br><br></span></p>\n<h2><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg\" alt=\"依赖项\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/collective\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg\" alt=\"需要 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/server.svg\" alt=\"环境：服务端\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/configurable.svg\" alt=\"可配置\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252fconfiguration-guide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/configuration-guide.svg\" alt=\"配置指南\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">所有可用的配置选项：</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\" style=\"margin-left:10px;padding-left:10px\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableBoggedSpawn</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableBreezeSpawn</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableCaveSpiderSpawn</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableGiantSpawn</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableHuskSpawn</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableMooshroomSpawn</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableMooshroomTweaks</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableMoreZombieVillagers</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableSkeletonHorseSpawn</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableStraySpawn</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableZombieHorseSpawn</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableZombieVillagersFromSpawner</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span></div>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/available-bundles.svg\" alt=\"可用整合包\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">以下 Serilum 模组整合包可供下载：</span></p>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-client-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/serilums-client-bundle.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#006994\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-client-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum 客户端整合包</a></td>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-customization-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/serilums-customization-bundle.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#999\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-customization-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum 自定义整合包</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-extra-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/serilums-extra-bundle.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#804d4f\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-extra-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum 额外整合包</a></td>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-qol-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/serilums-qol-bundle.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#bf8f6f\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-qol-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum 体验优化整合包</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-rpg-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/serilums-rpg-bundle.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#006b3f\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-rpg-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum RPG 整合包</a></td>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-spawn-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/serilums-spawn-bundle.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#805a46\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-spawn-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum 出生点整合包</a></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/mods-included.svg\" alt=\"包含的模组\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bogged-spawn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/bogged-spawn.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bogged-spawn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">沼泽骷髅生成</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">在所有地方自然生成沼泽骷髅的概率，替代普通骷髅。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/breeze-spawn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/breeze-spawn.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/breeze-spawn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">旋风人生成</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">在所有地方自然生成旋风人的概率，替代烈焰人。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cave-spider-spawn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/cave-spider-spawn.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cave-spider-spawn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">洞穴蜘蛛生成</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">在地下自然生成洞穴蜘蛛的概率，替代普通蜘蛛。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/giant-spawn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/giant-spawn.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/giant-spawn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">巨人生成</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">允许巨人自然生成，并附带基于僵尸的自定义 AI 及其他调整。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/husk-spawn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/husk-spawn.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/husk-spawn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">尸壳生成</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">在所有地方自然生成尸壳的概率，替代普通僵尸。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mooshroom-spawn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/mooshroom-spawn.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mooshroom-spawn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">哞菇生成</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">在所有地方自然生成哞菇的概率，替代普通牛。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mooshroom-tweaks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/mooshroom-tweaks.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mooshroom-tweaks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">哞菇调整</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">允许红色和棕色哞菇在其对应的生物群系中自然生成。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/more-zombie-villagers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/more-zombie-villagers.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/more-zombie-villagers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">更多僵尸村民</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">允许更改僵尸生成为村民变体的默认概率。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/skeleton-horse-spawn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/skeleton-horse-spawn.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/skeleton-horse-spawn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">骷髅马生成</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">允许骷髅马自然生成，并附带骷髅骑乘及其他调整。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/stray-spawn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/stray-spawn.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/stray-spawn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">流浪者生成</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">在所有地方自然生成流浪者的概率，替代普通骷髅。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/zombie-horse-spawn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/zombie-horse-spawn.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/zombie-horse-spawn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">僵尸马生成</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">允许僵尸马自然生成，并附带僵尸骑乘及其他调整。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/zombie-villagers-from-spawner\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/zombie-villagers-from-spawner.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/zombie-villagers-from-spawner\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">刷怪笼生成僵尸村民</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">恢复僵尸刷怪笼生成村民变体的能力（该功能在 1.11 版本中被移除）。</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg\" alt=\"Notes and links\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>Вы можете свободно использовать этот набор в любом модпаке при условии, что загрузка остаётся размещённой в экосистеме CurseForge или Modrinth.</strong></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px;color:#008000\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum.com</a> содержит обзор и дополнительную информацию обо всех доступных модах.</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Комментарии отключены, так как мне невозможно отслеживать их на стольких отдельных страницах модов.</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br>По вопросам, идеям, предложениям или любой другой обратной связи существует&nbsp;<a style=\"font-size:14px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub-репозиторий</a>. Спасибо!</span><span style=\"font-size:6px\"><br><br></span></p>",
